- You know, we should
have someone set it up


00:54:37.034 --> 00:54:39.034
so Tia comes on
the morning show.


00:54:39.068 --> 00:54:41.482
I mean, since coming on ourshow,
our numbers have increased


00:54:41.517 --> 00:54:44.344
and you know, she speaks
at events all over DC.


00:54:44.379 --> 00:54:45.965
- Great idea!


00:54:46.000 --> 00:54:47.724
I'll have Tracy set
up for next week!


00:54:47.758 --> 00:54:51.310
- Hmm, great!


00:54:51.344 --> 00:54:52.310
- Great!


00:54:52.344 --> 00:54:56.655
You know, I am so glad
you didn't let that huge


00:54:56.689 --> 00:55:00.827
embarrassing debacle
bring you down.


00:55:00.862 --> 00:55:03.655
I mean, losing a man and
your job in front of everyone,


00:55:03.689 --> 00:55:06.620
whew, that is tough.


00:55:06.655 --> 00:55:11.620
But, so glad to see ya
back on your two feet.


00:55:11.655 --> 00:55:15.000
Tracy'll call ya next week?


00:55:15.034 --> 00:55:16.724
- Great Shelby.


00:55:16.758 --> 00:55:17.724
- It was so nice meeting you.


00:55:17.758 --> 00:55:20.137
- Oh, wonderful.


00:55:20.172 --> 00:55:22.034
Nice to meet you too.


00:55:22.068 --> 00:55:23.379
- Thank you.


00:55:23.413 --> 00:55:25.034
I'm gon' let you
guys keep lunchin'.


00:55:25.068 --> 00:55:26.482
All right, come on honey.


00:55:26.517 --> 00:55:27.758
- Take care, Shelby!


00:55:28.931 --> 00:55:30.344
- What's up, superstar?


00:55:31.965 --> 00:55:33.551
- Austin, what are
you doing here?


00:55:33.586 --> 00:55:34.700
- Actually I wanna get
to that in a second,


00:55:34.724 --> 00:55:36.034
but I have a question for you.


00:55:36.068 --> 00:55:41.068
Uh, you and Jillian,
y'all close?


00:55:42.655 --> 00:55:43.700
- Yeah, she's been my
best friend since high school.


00:55:43.724 --> 00:55:44.896
Why are you asking about her?


00:55:44.931 --> 00:55:46.448
- No reason.


00:55:46.482 --> 00:55:48.931
Van gon' be late,
so here's some cards for support.


00:55:51.689 --> 00:55:52.896
- What's this?


00:55:52.931 --> 00:55:54.838
- Just some bullet points
that I think you should mention.


00:55:54.862 --> 00:55:56.379
- Oh, I already have my bullets.


00:55:56.413 --> 00:55:57.551
- And here are a few more.


00:55:57.586 --> 00:55:59.103
You haven't read
em, check it out.


00:56:00.965 --> 00:56:02.872
- Boy, I'm not talkin' about
your weekly countdown show!


00:56:02.896 --> 00:56:04.551
It's not even on TV.


00:56:04.586 --> 00:56:05.965
- It's a village.


00:56:06.000 --> 00:56:06.896
I'm supposed to support you,
you gotta support me back!


00:56:06.931 --> 00:56:08.689
- No, Austin.


00:56:08.724 --> 00:56:10.172
I already have enough
to think about.


00:56:10.206 --> 00:56:11.976
- Tia, you wouldn't even
be here if it wasn't for me.


00:56:12.000 --> 00:56:13.000
Man, I'm...


00:56:14.103 --> 00:56:15.103
- What?


00:56:18.068 --> 00:56:20.931
- Look,
when you was wilin' out in the streets,


00:56:20.965 --> 00:56:23.000
I was gettin' a smoothie.


00:56:23.034 --> 00:56:25.103
I bumped the footage to Van.


00:56:25.137 --> 00:56:27.655
He thought it was funny,
so we broke the story.


00:56:28.793 --> 00:56:29.907
It started to blow
up on social media,


00:56:29.931 --> 00:56:33.034
he offers you a job,
instant ratings.


00:56:33.068 --> 00:56:35.172
You got me to thank
for your success!


00:56:36.172 --> 00:56:37.172
Remember that.


00:56:39.551 --> 00:56:41.103
- You ready to do this?


00:56:52.655 --> 00:56:57.655
Our next guest at Wake
Up DC is no stranger to us.


00:56:58.620 --> 00:57:01.724
In fact, she used to
host this morning show.


00:57:01.758 --> 00:57:04.517
Please welcome Tia Logan.


00:57:04.551 --> 00:57:05.562
- And thank you for
having me, Shelby.


00:57:05.586 --> 00:57:06.758
I'm happy to be here.


00:57:06.793 --> 00:57:08.079
- Oh, it's
great to have you here.


00:57:08.103 --> 00:57:09.689
I mean, ya look amazing.


00:57:09.724 --> 00:57:11.068
- Thank you.


00:57:11.103 --> 00:57:12.217
- Looks like life
has been treating you well.


00:57:12.241 --> 00:57:13.586
- It has, it has.


00:57:13.620 --> 00:57:15.620
I never thought I would
be on this side of


00:57:15.655 --> 00:57:17.551
the morning show, but here I am.


00:57:17.586 --> 00:57:18.551
- Yes, yes.


00:57:18.586 --> 00:57:21.793
Ya know, so let's go back.


00:57:21.827 --> 00:57:25.172
A few months ago, you
broke the internet


00:57:25.206 --> 00:57:27.517
with a video that surfaced.


00:57:27.551 --> 00:57:30.275
In fact, we have it.


00:57:34.586 --> 00:57:35.700
- The wedding is off!
- It's not what you think.


00:57:35.724 --> 00:57:36.551
- The wedding is off!


00:57:36.586 --> 00:57:37.827
- See Malcolm,


00:57:37.862 --> 00:57:38.793
you need to handle all this.
- Wait, baby wait.


00:57:38.827 --> 00:57:39.862
- Bitch, what?!


00:57:42.620 --> 00:57:46.620
- So Tia, we all
would like to know,


00:57:47.793 --> 00:57:50.862
are you still that angry woman?


00:57:50.896 --> 00:57:53.931
- No Shelby, actually, I'm not.


00:57:53.965 --> 00:57:56.965
I look at that situation
as a blessing in disguise.


00:57:57.000 --> 00:57:59.551
Had that not happened, I
wouldn't have discovered


00:57:59.586 --> 00:58:01.793
this beautiful career
which I love so much.


00:58:02.758 --> 00:58:04.689
- And before we talk about that,


00:58:04.724 --> 00:58:07.931
we love to do
where are they now?


00:58:07.965 --> 00:58:10.344
So, we reached out to your ex


00:58:10.379 --> 00:58:13.275
so we can get an update
on his total annihilation.


00:58:13.310 --> 00:58:16.310
Please, please, let's
give a warm welcome


00:58:16.344 --> 00:58:17.758
to Malcolm Wright.


00:58:17.793 --> 00:58:18.793
- What?


00:58:21.034 --> 00:58:24.000
- Malcolm, welcome.


00:58:24.034 --> 00:58:24.965
- Oh, thank you.


00:58:25.000 --> 00:58:25.896
Thank you for having me.


00:58:25.931 --> 00:58:27.034
- Oh, thank you for coming.


00:58:27.068 --> 00:58:30.862
So, Malcolm, tell us,
how have you been?


00:58:32.034 --> 00:58:36.034
- Oh well Shelby,
if you had asked me that a few weeks ago,


00:58:36.068 --> 00:58:37.206
I would've said terrible.


00:58:38.379 --> 00:58:41.827
But, now that I have
my other half back,


00:58:41.862 --> 00:58:43.034
things couldn't be better.


00:58:43.068 --> 00:58:44.896
- Oh, how sweet!


00:58:44.931 --> 00:58:48.620
So, are you telling us that
you two are back together?


00:58:48.655 --> 00:58:50.172
- No.
- Well actually,


00:58:53.310 --> 00:58:55.931
Tia, I love you


00:58:57.137 --> 00:59:00.379
and I wanna spend the rest
of my life making you happy.


00:59:01.689 --> 00:59:03.379
Will you please marry me?


00:59:05.862 --> 00:59:06.862
- Well?


00:59:07.931 --> 00:59:09.896
- I don't wanna do this here.


00:59:09.931 --> 00:59:13.344
- Believe me when I say
that I know that there is


00:59:13.379 --> 00:59:16.103
no one I'd rather
spend my forever with.


00:59:17.862 --> 00:59:20.206
We're gonna have a
great life together.


00:59:20.241 --> 00:59:22.413
- Girl, are you gon' sit
here and let that man


00:59:22.448 --> 00:59:27.655
pour his heart out in
front of 3.5 million people?


00:59:28.068 --> 00:59:29.137
- 3.5?


00:59:29.172 --> 00:59:31.172
- Yes, it's gone up
since I've become host.


00:59:38.068 --> 00:59:42.000
- Yes, yes I will
marry you Malcolm.


00:59:42.034 --> 00:59:43.965
- That is beautiful!


00:59:44.000 --> 00:59:47.000
Look,
you have heard it here first on Wake Up DC.


00:59:47.034 --> 00:59:50.862
#AngryBlackWoman is
now #HappyBrideToBe.


00:59:53.068 --> 00:59:54.068
Again!


00:59:55.379 --> 00:59:56.379
We'll be right back.


01:00:08.965 --> 01:00:10.355
- What's up with you and
what was up with Malcolm?


01:00:10.379 --> 01:00:11.206
What was that?
- I didn't plan that.


01:00:11.241 --> 01:00:12.689
I didn't plan that.


01:00:13.724 --> 01:00:15.310
When were you gonna tell me?


01:00:15.344 --> 01:00:16.172
- Tell you what?


01:00:16.206 --> 01:00:17.896
- You used me!


01:00:17.931 --> 01:00:19.965
Austin shot the video
and you broke the story.


01:00:20.000 --> 01:00:21.689
Oh, I respect your art.


01:00:21.724 --> 01:00:22.838
You the best of both worlds.


01:00:22.862 --> 01:00:24.172
It's all bullshit!


01:00:24.206 --> 01:00:25.275
- That was the truth!


01:00:25.310 --> 01:00:26.862
But I still got a job, Tia!


01:00:26.896 --> 01:00:27.896
I still got a job!


01:00:29.172 --> 01:00:31.217
- You know what,
you're worse than Malcolm


01:00:31.241 --> 01:00:32.838
but at least Malcolm
knows how to stand up


01:00:32.862 --> 01:00:34.275
and be a real man.


01:00:34.310 --> 01:00:37.655
- OK yes, OK yes,
I should've told you, all right?


01:00:37.689 --> 01:00:39.689
I should've told you but I
wanted you here because


01:00:39.724 --> 01:00:42.655
I know you still got so
much more to offer, OK?


01:00:42.689 --> 01:00:43.965
- You know what, it's funny.


01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:45.965
I'm quitting for the
exact same reason.


01:00:47.206 --> 01:00:49.206
I thought you were
one of the good guys.


01:00:54.758 --> 01:00:55.758
- Man!


01:00:56.413 --> 01:00:58.068
- You did what?


01:00:58.103 --> 01:01:00.275
- I needed to forgive him.


01:01:00.310 --> 01:01:02.275
- Then say we're
cool, don't say I do!


01:01:02.310 --> 01:01:03.896
- It's hard out here, Jillian.


01:01:03.931 --> 01:01:04.758
- Yeah, sure it is.


01:01:04.793 --> 01:01:06.241
- It is hard!


01:01:06.275 --> 01:01:08.034
And Malcolm wants to be with me.


01:01:08.068 --> 01:01:11.137
No, he's not perfect but
at least he's trying.


01:01:11.172 --> 01:01:13.068
- You know who you sound
like right about now?


01:01:13.103 --> 01:01:14.034
- So what?


01:01:14.068 --> 01:01:15.965
There's nothing wrong with


01:01:16.000 --> 01:01:17.182
wanting to have a
good life, Jillian.


01:01:17.206 --> 01:01:19.482
The big picture is
what's important.


01:01:19.517 --> 01:01:21.931
- But Tia, do you
love him, honestly?


01:01:21.965 --> 01:01:23.068
- Yes!


01:01:24.448 --> 01:01:26.000
- Well, there you have it.


01:01:26.034 --> 01:01:27.965
I guess settling
is the new love.


01:01:28.000 --> 01:01:29.493
- At least I'm willing
to put myself out here


01:01:29.517 --> 01:01:31.137
even after I've been hurt.


01:01:31.172 --> 01:01:32.793
Yeah, you haven't
given a man a real shot


01:01:32.827 --> 01:01:34.068
since Brooks left.


01:01:34.103 --> 01:01:36.182
Yeah you claim to be this,
"Oh I'm a free spirited person,"


01:01:36.206 --> 01:01:38.000
but it's all a facade.


01:01:38.034 --> 01:01:39.413
You never take any
chances anymore,


01:01:39.448 --> 01:01:41.068
not with anything!


01:01:41.103 --> 01:01:44.000
- Well at least I don't
keep making bad decisions!


01:01:44.034 --> 01:01:46.827
- It takes courage to
keep getting back out here.


01:01:46.862 --> 01:01:47.862
What are you doing?


01:01:48.827 --> 01:01:50.286
- I'm not runnin' around
here making people think


01:01:50.310 --> 01:01:51.896
I got it all.


01:01:51.931 --> 01:01:52.827
- Yeah,
because you went around here sleeping with


01:01:52.862 --> 01:01:54.068
every Tom, Dick, and Butch.


01:01:55.517 --> 01:01:56.517
- Get out.


01:01:58.034 --> 01:01:59.034
Get out!


01:02:00.931 --> 01:02:02.482
- You know what?


01:02:02.517 --> 01:02:04.310
Can't tell you anything.


01:02:04.344 --> 01:02:06.064
- And take your stanky
ass flowers with you!


01:02:11.448 --> 01:02:14.379
- This advice thing
is a lot of pressure.


01:02:14.413 --> 01:02:16.931
I met this woman today
who took her husband back


01:02:16.965 --> 01:02:18.793
simply because I took you back.


01:02:19.586 --> 01:02:21.275
- That's a good thing, right?


01:02:21.310 --> 01:02:22.310
- I guess.


01:02:23.344 --> 01:02:25.068
But what if she shouldn't have?


01:02:25.103 --> 01:02:26.941
She's lookin' at my life
like it's perfect but...


01:02:26.965 --> 01:02:29.206
- It is perfect
especially now that you


01:02:29.241 --> 01:02:30.862
over that angry black thing.


01:02:31.827 --> 01:02:34.068
I gotta say, that did
not go over too well


01:02:34.103 --> 01:02:36.103
with the overheads at the firm.


01:02:36.137 --> 01:02:38.068
My father was certainly
not impressed.


01:02:46.068 --> 01:02:48.034
- What are you lookin' at?


01:02:48.068 --> 01:02:49.172
- Give me back my phone.


01:02:49.206 --> 01:02:50.103
- What's the problem?


01:02:50.137 --> 01:02:51.148
I can't look through your phone?


01:02:51.172 --> 01:02:52.551
- You can look through my phone,


01:02:52.586 --> 01:02:55.034
but you should ask instead
of just grabbing it from me.


01:02:57.551 --> 01:02:58.965
I know you don't trust me.


01:02:59.000 --> 01:03:00.275
- Should I?


01:03:00.310 --> 01:03:02.000
- I don't have anything to hide.


01:03:03.413 --> 01:03:05.034
I promise.


01:03:05.068 --> 01:03:06.310
Go ahead, look.


01:03:12.103 --> 01:03:13.862
- Fine then, I will.


01:03:16.137 --> 01:03:17.586
- Uh huh, told you.


01:03:20.068 --> 01:03:22.137
I'm doin' right by you, baby.


01:03:28.620 --> 01:03:31.344
- TJ called me about
coming back to the station


01:03:31.379 --> 01:03:33.206
to be a field reporter.


01:03:33.241 --> 01:03:34.241
- You should.


01:03:35.517 --> 01:03:37.044
- But I don't know if I
wanna go back to that old,


01:03:37.068 --> 01:03:38.931
stuffy job.


01:03:38.965 --> 01:03:41.551
- That's the beauty
of being married to me.


01:03:42.724 --> 01:03:45.620
You can go back to work or
you can just be Mrs. Wright.


01:03:45.655 --> 01:03:46.931
- Logan-Wright.


01:03:47.965 --> 01:03:49.206
- I'll just call you mine.


01:03:50.137 --> 01:03:52.310
Now seriously, I gotta
get back to work.


01:03:58.413 --> 01:04:01.000
- Oh, I signed us up for
Paint and Sip tomorrow.


01:04:14.241 --> 01:04:16.241
- I'm sorry about
the paint thing.


01:04:16.275 --> 01:04:17.620
- It wasn't a thing.


01:04:18.517 --> 01:04:20.241
It was supposed to be a date.


01:04:21.586 --> 01:04:24.241
- I should pick the
dates from now on.


01:04:24.275 --> 01:04:28.344
- It's not always going to be about you,
Malcolm.


01:04:29.517 --> 01:04:32.448
- Look, compromises
are hard for me.


01:04:33.586 --> 01:04:36.620
- Marriage is one
big compromise.


01:04:36.655 --> 01:04:37.655
- I know.


01:04:38.517 --> 01:04:39.517
I know.


01:04:40.517 --> 01:04:42.103
So please be patient with me.


01:04:44.000 --> 01:04:45.103
I'm a work in progress.


01:04:51.655 --> 01:04:52.655
You know what?


01:04:54.103 --> 01:04:56.286
Why don't we just go down
to the courthouse this Friday.


01:04:56.310 --> 01:04:58.344
I mean, let's just
go ahead and do it.


01:04:58.379 --> 01:04:59.665
I don't want to wait and besides,
I don't have time


01:04:59.689 --> 01:05:01.103
to plan anything big.


01:05:02.241 --> 01:05:04.000
- You didn't really
plan the last one.


01:05:04.724 --> 01:05:05.724
- Tia.


01:05:07.206 --> 01:05:09.413
All I care about
is marrying you.


01:05:12.724 --> 01:05:14.137
- OK.


01:05:14.172 --> 01:05:16.551
But since the
reception is paid for,


01:05:16.586 --> 01:05:18.448
can we still do the
party next month?


01:05:19.482 --> 01:05:22.689
- Sure, whatever my baby wants.


01:05:40.275 --> 01:05:41.172
- Don't do that.


01:05:41.206 --> 01:05:42.137
Let it happen naturally.


01:05:42.172 --> 01:05:43.355
Do not put yourself out there.


01:05:43.379 --> 01:05:45.137
Once you do that, you
can't go back and yo,


01:05:45.172 --> 01:05:47.448
once they break up with
you, they gon' act like,


01:05:47.482 --> 01:05:49.286
oh they had the upper
hand the whole entire time


01:05:49.310 --> 01:05:50.310
and it's not the case.


01:05:50.344 --> 01:05:51.620
Damn man.


01:05:51.655 --> 01:05:52.551
- You good bro?


01:05:52.586 --> 01:05:54.344
You the angry black woman now?


01:05:55.586 --> 01:05:56.758
- Oh no, I'm good.


01:05:56.793 --> 01:05:58.217
I'm just sayin', you
know what I'm sayin',


01:05:58.241 --> 01:05:59.586
just trying to help.


01:05:59.620 --> 01:06:03.206
- OK.


01:06:03.241 --> 01:06:05.206
- I say be honest.


01:06:05.241 --> 01:06:06.758
Test the waters.


01:06:06.793 --> 01:06:09.034
Give him signals to let
him know you're interested


01:06:09.068 --> 01:06:10.241
and see how he responds.


01:06:11.655 --> 01:06:14.137
If you get nothing, back up.


01:06:19.827 --> 01:06:21.241
- I'll tell you.


01:06:21.275 --> 01:06:22.413
I'll show you a picture.


01:06:22.448 --> 01:06:23.827
Don't button it
up, I like it open.


01:06:23.862 --> 01:06:24.689
- You like it open?
- Yes.


01:06:24.724 --> 01:06:25.758
- I like it closed.


01:06:25.793 --> 01:06:26.586
- Hey Van.
- Hey, what up, dawg?


01:06:26.620 --> 01:06:27.482
- How y'all doin'?


01:06:27.517 --> 01:06:29.413
- No just...


01:06:29.448 --> 01:06:32.551
- Open it again.


01:06:32.586 --> 01:06:35.344
- That's definitely in.


01:06:35.379 --> 01:06:36.793
You are hilarious.


01:06:43.689 --> 01:06:44.758
- That's cute.


01:06:46.793 --> 01:06:49.793
- May I set a
dressing room for you?


01:06:52.586 --> 01:06:53.586
- Sure.


01:06:56.310 --> 01:06:58.206
Uh, let's see.


01:06:58.241 --> 01:06:59.310
This one too.


01:07:02.206 --> 01:07:03.206
Thank you.


01:07:22.448 --> 01:07:23.586
- Get in here.


01:07:24.724 --> 01:07:26.137
Grayson called me
about the book.


01:07:26.172 --> 01:07:29.137
- I know, I guess it
wasn't meant to be.


01:07:29.172 --> 01:07:30.137
- What?!


01:07:30.172 --> 01:07:31.862
No, I'm not gon'
let you give up!


01:07:31.896 --> 01:07:33.724
I thought it was a
really good idea.


01:07:33.758 --> 01:07:34.862
- Hm, you cookin'?


01:07:34.896 --> 01:07:36.793
- No, you know I don't cook.


01:07:36.827 --> 01:07:37.689
- Smells like you
burnin' something.


01:07:37.724 --> 01:07:39.689
- I don't cook.


01:07:41.137 --> 01:07:42.827
I need to get the
elephant out the room.


01:07:43.965 --> 01:07:46.551
I'm sleeping with Austin.
- I'm still marrying Malcolm.


01:07:46.586 --> 01:07:47.689
Wait, that's the elephant?!


01:07:47.724 --> 01:07:50.413
- I know.


01:07:50.448 --> 01:07:52.827
I just gotta get it
off my conscience.


01:07:52.862 --> 01:07:56.655
Listen,
I know he's young but what he lacks in age,


01:07:56.689 --> 01:07:58.448
he makes up for in bed.


01:07:58.482 --> 01:07:59.793
You hear me?


01:07:59.827 --> 01:08:01.758
He's so young, he's so vibrant.


01:08:01.793 --> 01:08:03.689
He just stimulate my whole body.


01:08:03.724 --> 01:08:06.758
He just do somethin' to
me like you see it right now?


01:08:06.793 --> 01:08:08.689
It's happening, you know?


01:08:08.724 --> 01:08:11.310
- Oh God, the last thing
I need is the image


01:08:11.344 --> 01:08:12.620
of you and Austin.


01:08:12.655 --> 01:08:13.655
- Shut up.


01:08:15.586 --> 01:08:16.586
You talk to Van?


01:08:19.206 --> 01:08:21.482
OK, he talked to Ms.
Rashild about what happened


01:08:21.517 --> 01:08:22.517
on the morning show.


01:08:23.517 --> 01:08:24.689
She made a call.


01:08:24.724 --> 01:08:27.517
Once again, Shelby
is field anchor.


01:08:27.551 --> 01:08:29.655
So it's bye bye DC!


01:08:29.689 --> 01:08:30.827
- What?


01:08:30.862 --> 01:08:31.827
- Yes, so I told you
that woman was powerful!


01:08:31.862 --> 01:08:33.344
- Oh my God!


01:08:35.793 --> 01:08:37.413
- I couldn't stand her anyway!


01:08:37.448 --> 01:08:38.488
- Oh my gosh, I hated her.


01:08:38.517 --> 01:08:39.665
- They needed to just fire her.


01:08:39.689 --> 01:08:40.517
I don't know why they
holdin' onto her.


01:08:40.551 --> 01:08:41.758
- I know, let her go!


01:08:41.793 --> 01:08:42.803
- They might as well
just take you back.


01:08:42.827 --> 01:08:44.206
- I'm here.


01:08:44.241 --> 01:08:45.689
- I'm sayin'!


01:08:45.724 --> 01:08:46.620
- Right!


01:08:46.655 --> 01:08:47.769
That's why you my best friend.


01:08:47.793 --> 01:08:48.896
- I know.


01:08:48.931 --> 01:08:50.571
We should take a girl's
trip this weekend.


01:08:53.655 --> 01:08:54.655
What?


01:08:55.413 --> 01:08:56.758
- I'm getting married Friday.


01:09:02.862 --> 01:09:03.931
Hey, this is Tia.


01:09:03.965 --> 01:09:05.413
I'm unavailable right now.


01:09:05.448 --> 01:09:06.793
Please leave a message.


01:09:06.827 --> 01:09:08.586
- Hey Tia, it's Van.


01:09:08.620 --> 01:09:10.310
I sent a text the other day.


01:09:10.344 --> 01:09:11.896
I thought I'd just
leave a message.


01:09:11.931 --> 01:09:13.517
I um...


01:09:16.068 --> 01:09:18.275
I need to talk to you
about your key card.


01:09:18.310 --> 01:09:19.655
You still have it.


01:09:38.310 --> 01:09:40.413
- It might've cost me
a bag, but I did it


01:09:40.448 --> 01:09:42.551
and I got my girl back.


01:09:42.586 --> 01:09:43.724
Now what?


01:09:43.758 --> 01:09:45.931
Can't keep a winner down, baby.


01:09:52.379 --> 01:09:54.517
- Go ahead babe, I need
to find a parking spot.


01:09:54.551 --> 01:09:55.700
- You're coming in, aren't you?


01:09:55.724 --> 01:09:58.689
- If I find a
parking space, maybe.


01:09:58.724 --> 01:10:01.482
If not, it's up to the universe.


01:10:05.586 --> 01:10:07.241
Go on now!


01:10:14.379 --> 01:10:15.034
- Hurry up!


01:10:15.068 --> 01:10:16.068
- Good luck.


01:10:17.551 --> 01:10:19.655
- Oh there's my
baby right there.


01:10:26.310 --> 01:10:27.655
- Uh, how you doin'?


01:10:27.689 --> 01:10:28.551
- Good!


01:10:28.586 --> 01:10:29.758
- Let me see this.


01:10:29.793 --> 01:10:30.724
Come on, let's see this.


01:10:30.758 --> 01:10:31.838
Let's take this right here.


01:10:35.724 --> 01:10:36.793
Look at that!


01:10:37.931 --> 01:10:39.482
Hey baby, come on.


01:10:39.517 --> 01:10:42.827
Why don't you tell the world
how much you love me, hmm?


01:10:46.793 --> 01:10:49.310
All right OK, look,
tell the people,


01:10:49.344 --> 01:10:51.344
you know, how glad you're happy


01:10:51.379 --> 01:10:53.931
to have your man back.


01:10:53.965 --> 01:10:55.275
Yeah.


01:10:55.310 --> 01:10:57.551
- Oh, I can't marry you.


01:10:59.344 --> 01:11:01.551
- Come on, stop trippin' babe.


01:11:01.586 --> 01:11:02.896
Tell the people.


01:11:02.931 --> 01:11:05.034
- Hey world.


01:11:05.068 --> 01:11:07.344
You wanna know how much
I love Malcolm Wright?


01:11:07.379 --> 01:11:10.034
Not as much as I love myself.


01:11:10.068 --> 01:11:13.655
I can't marry you, Malcolm.


01:11:14.586 --> 01:11:16.000
- What?


01:11:16.034 --> 01:11:18.586
- This isn't real but one day,
I hope that we both


01:11:18.620 --> 01:11:20.551
can find someone
who can appreciate


01:11:20.586 --> 01:11:22.862
and love us for
who we truly are.


01:11:39.655 --> 01:11:41.827
- Dude, are you still live?


01:11:47.793 --> 01:11:49.010
- Oh, I was just
about to walk over.


01:11:49.034 --> 01:11:52.034
- Relax, I'm not
getting married.


01:11:52.068 --> 01:11:52.896
- What?


01:11:52.931 --> 01:11:54.034
What did he do?


01:11:54.068 --> 01:11:54.896
- Calm down, calm down.


01:11:54.931 --> 01:11:56.068
He didn't do anything.


01:11:56.103 --> 01:11:59.413
Malcolm is who he is
and I was silly enough


01:11:59.448 --> 01:12:00.793
to believe that that was enough


01:12:00.827 --> 01:12:02.724
and for somebody, it will be.


01:12:02.758 --> 01:12:06.517
But I just realized that I need
and deserve so much more.


01:12:07.620 --> 01:12:09.068
- And what made you
realize that, T?


01:12:14.931 --> 01:12:16.413
T, this face!


01:12:16.448 --> 01:12:17.827
- I know.


01:12:17.862 --> 01:12:20.862
- Oh, you know what,
you know I'm here if you need me,


01:12:20.896 --> 01:12:22.113
if you need a place to stay,
you know I got you.


01:12:22.137 --> 01:12:23.724
- I'm getting my own place.


01:12:23.758 --> 01:12:24.689
- Say that again.


01:12:24.724 --> 01:12:26.448
- I'm getting my own place.


01:12:29.448 --> 01:12:32.379
- You know what you be doin'!


01:12:32.413 --> 01:12:34.068
- OK girl, you don't
have to be so happy!


01:12:34.103 --> 01:12:36.044
- You don't understand,
you was takin' up my space.


01:12:36.068 --> 01:12:37.068
My goodness!


01:12:38.068 --> 01:12:39.448
- You know what?


01:12:39.482 --> 01:12:40.631
I think it's time for
me to get reacquainted


01:12:40.655 --> 01:12:41.655
with the real me.


01:12:42.517 --> 01:12:43.482
- You know what?


01:12:43.517 --> 01:12:44.965
I like the real you.


01:12:45.000 --> 01:12:46.517
Free girl. - Yeah!


01:12:46.551 --> 01:12:49.655
- She be a little bitter sometimes,
but she all right.


01:12:49.689 --> 01:12:51.068
- Ah, the past is the past.


01:12:51.103 --> 01:12:52.586
Oh girl, listen!


01:12:59.827 --> 01:13:01.034
Coming!


01:13:01.068 --> 01:13:05.172
I said I'm coming!


01:13:05.206 --> 01:13:06.689
Damn, I just.


01:13:06.724 --> 01:13:08.103
I said I'm comin'!


01:13:08.137 --> 01:13:09.137
Just hold on, just...


01:13:11.241 --> 01:13:12.793
- I need to see your book.


01:13:12.827 --> 01:13:14.068
- What book?


01:13:14.103 --> 01:13:15.827
- The one I'm publishing.


01:13:15.862 --> 01:13:18.482
- Oh my gosh, ah!


01:13:18.517 --> 01:13:20.586
- Tia, Tia!


01:13:20.620 --> 01:13:23.482
You know I don't like
all that mushy stuff.


01:13:23.517 --> 01:13:25.586
Give me a high
five or something.


01:13:25.620 --> 01:13:27.862
Look, I know you said I
don't take chances anymore.


01:13:27.896 --> 01:13:30.689
So, if I'm gon' step out there,


01:13:30.724 --> 01:13:33.517
why not take a bet on
somebody I believe in?


01:13:33.551 --> 01:13:34.689
- Oh my God.


01:13:34.724 --> 01:13:36.689
I've already started
collecting the stories.


01:13:36.724 --> 01:13:38.448
Wait, hoo, hoo, hoo.


01:13:42.862 --> 01:13:44.448
- Tia, what are you doin'?


01:13:48.586 --> 01:13:49.586
- Here.


01:13:50.931 --> 01:13:52.517
Girl, all kinda stories.


01:13:52.551 --> 01:13:54.517
Races, religions, everything.


01:13:54.551 --> 01:13:56.655
This is gonna be so dope.


01:13:58.068 --> 01:14:00.137
- And since it's
already written,


01:14:00.172 --> 01:14:01.551
it's just a matter of editing.


01:14:01.586 --> 01:14:03.137
And I know tons of editors.


01:14:03.172 --> 01:14:04.655
Might take a few weeks.


01:14:04.689 --> 01:14:05.517
- Really?


01:14:05.551 --> 01:14:06.517
- Yes.


01:14:06.551 --> 01:14:08.148
- That's my best friend,
that's my best friend,


01:14:08.172 --> 01:14:09.689
friend, friend,
aye, get it friend!


01:14:09.724 --> 01:14:11.275
Aye, that's my friend!


01:14:11.310 --> 01:14:12.793
Hey!


01:14:12.827 --> 01:14:14.517
Oh, oh, you know
what we should do?


01:14:14.551 --> 01:14:17.000
We should plan a
huge release party


01:14:17.034 --> 01:14:19.655
and announce the book
and your publishing.


01:14:20.724 --> 01:14:21.551
- I like that.


01:14:21.586 --> 01:14:22.965
You know what?


01:14:23.000 --> 01:14:24.793
I'm gon' start
lookin' for venues.


01:14:27.793 --> 01:14:29.758
- No need!


01:14:31.206 --> 01:14:33.620
I know the perfect place.


01:14:33.655 --> 01:14:37.896
- Hey, hey!


01:14:40.724 --> 01:14:44.551
- Yes, lookin' like
a cherry popsicle.


01:14:44.586 --> 01:14:45.172
Come on in.


01:14:45.206 --> 01:14:46.206
Hey love.


01:14:47.689 --> 01:14:48.517
Hi!


01:14:48.551 --> 01:14:49.965
- Hi, I'm with WBX News.


01:14:50.000 --> 01:14:50.896
- Yeah.


01:14:50.931 --> 01:14:51.827
- Your face looks so familiar.


01:14:51.862 --> 01:14:53.000
- Oh nope, I don't know you.


01:14:53.034 --> 01:14:53.827
You look good.
- What do you mean


01:14:53.862 --> 01:14:54.793
you don't know me?


01:14:54.827 --> 01:14:55.976
- Purple little shirt.


01:14:56.000 --> 01:14:57.079
- You know, I need
to get in there.


01:14:57.103 --> 01:14:58.517
- Oh you don't, 'cause sir,


01:14:58.551 --> 01:14:59.724
she's not allowed to come in.


01:14:59.758 --> 01:15:01.148
You have a good day,
Betty Bo Peep, bye!


01:15:01.172 --> 01:15:02.758
- It's my assignment.


01:15:02.793 --> 01:15:04.103
I'm with WBX News.


01:15:04.137 --> 01:15:05.758
What is her name?


01:15:25.103 --> 01:15:26.034
- You kissed him!


01:15:26.068 --> 01:15:27.724
- What, no I didn't.


01:15:27.758 --> 01:15:29.103
- I saw you!


01:15:29.137 --> 01:15:30.275
- No, you're seeing things.


01:15:30.310 --> 01:15:31.596
I don't know what
you're talkin' about.


01:15:31.620 --> 01:15:33.931
- I'm not seeing
anything but that kiss.


01:15:33.965 --> 01:15:36.206
- Tia, don't you
have something to do?


01:15:38.827 --> 01:15:40.965
- I am so excited about tonight


01:15:41.000 --> 01:15:43.758
and the release of my new book!


01:15:46.965 --> 01:15:49.827
I'm even more excited
to be doing this project


01:15:49.862 --> 01:15:52.896
with my best friend,
Jillian James.


01:15:54.724 --> 01:15:55.724
Proud of us.


01:15:57.896 --> 01:16:00.965
In my journey over the last year


01:16:01.000 --> 01:16:04.344
being the angry black woman,
I realized that most of


01:16:04.379 --> 01:16:07.206
the women I came across
had the same thing in common.


01:16:08.310 --> 01:16:09.689
Loneliness.


01:16:11.034 --> 01:16:15.241
Most times, it's the root of our anger,
our jealousy.


01:16:15.275 --> 01:16:18.241
And for me, I desired
to be accepted.


01:16:20.103 --> 01:16:22.689
Loneliness breaks the
spirit and no one can soar


01:16:22.724 --> 01:16:24.206
with a broken spirit.


01:16:25.137 --> 01:16:29.413
But, after receiving
several thousand emails


01:16:29.448 --> 01:16:32.068
from women all
across the country,


01:16:32.103 --> 01:16:34.931
I realized that we never
need to feel lonely.


01:16:36.206 --> 01:16:37.793
Why?


01:16:37.827 --> 01:16:40.206
Because we're all dealing
with the same concerns,


01:16:40.241 --> 01:16:44.862
the same issues, the
same insecurities.


01:16:44.896 --> 01:16:46.827
We just need to
connect to each other.


01:16:48.103 --> 01:16:52.344
And I hope that my new
book can bridge that gap.


01:16:53.862 --> 01:16:56.724
The Joy Of Losing It
All is a compilation of


01:16:56.758 --> 01:17:00.931
100 stories from women
who lost or walked away from


01:17:00.965 --> 01:17:04.896
everything and in the process,
found themselves.


01:17:04.931 --> 01:17:07.482
These are uplifting stories,
heartfelt stories


01:17:07.517 --> 01:17:10.034
about women who
rose from the ashes,


01:17:10.068 --> 01:17:14.000
dusted themselves off,
and decided to soar.


01:17:17.241 --> 01:17:21.482
Can the authors who are
in the house tonight


01:17:21.517 --> 01:17:23.413
come and join me up here?


01:17:23.448 --> 01:17:26.344
Just right here, yeah.


01:17:26.379 --> 01:17:27.379
Thank you.


01:17:29.206 --> 01:17:33.379
Gloria lost her son and
the foundation in his honor


01:17:33.413 --> 01:17:36.241
has fed thousands of kids.


01:17:36.275 --> 01:17:38.896
Keisha escaped an
abusive marriage


01:17:38.931 --> 01:17:41.275
and she mentors girl
all around the world.


01:17:41.310 --> 01:17:44.000
Listen hey, I can keep going.


01:17:44.034 --> 01:17:45.344
But what I wanna do right now


01:17:46.827 --> 01:17:49.379
is read to you just one
of the amazing stories


01:17:49.413 --> 01:17:51.206
so you can see what I'm saying.


01:17:52.793 --> 01:17:55.275
I'm in my 30's and I'm
a pretty powerful person


01:17:55.310 --> 01:17:57.068
when it comes to my career.


01:17:57.103 --> 01:17:58.448
I'm driven by work.


01:17:58.482 --> 01:18:00.517
It has been the only
thing that is motivating me


01:18:00.551 --> 01:18:02.034
over the years.


01:18:02.068 --> 01:18:04.379
So much so that I related my personal value


01:18:04.413 --> 01:18:06.793
to my career success.


01:18:06.827 --> 01:18:09.965
Eventually, my brand
became my career.


01:18:10.000 --> 01:18:13.172
I was fine with that until I
hurt someone I cared about,


01:18:13.206 --> 01:18:16.482
which made me reevaluate
what was important.


01:18:16.517 --> 01:18:21.000
Success doesn't matter if
you lose yourself in the process.


01:18:21.034 --> 01:18:24.103
Maybe that's why it's
lonely at the top.


01:18:25.344 --> 01:18:28.275
But after losing this person,
I realized that I don't wanna


01:18:28.310 --> 01:18:30.000
be at the top by myself.


01:18:31.206 --> 01:18:35.000
I found someone to walk this
journey with and I'm hoping


01:18:35.034 --> 01:18:39.034
I can get a second
chance to show...


01:18:45.862 --> 01:18:49.000
that I am really one
of the good guys.


01:19:02.241 --> 01:19:03.241
- I'm sorry, Tia.


01:19:05.068 --> 01:19:06.448
Let me start over.


01:19:11.620 --> 01:19:14.344
- Wow, that's one woman
who won't be angry


01:19:14.379 --> 01:19:15.827
or lonely for a long time!


01:19:18.655 --> 01:19:22.517
- So um, I've been thinking.


01:19:22.551 --> 01:19:25.413
I really miss being on the show.


01:19:27.068 --> 01:19:28.137
Think I can come back?


01:19:29.655 --> 01:19:30.655
- No.


01:19:33.586 --> 01:19:35.044
We ain't gonna have no time
to be on The Gossip Room


01:19:35.068 --> 01:19:38.068
when we're busy prepping
your own show every day.


01:19:39.068 --> 01:19:40.068
- My own show?


01:19:40.896 --> 01:19:43.413
- I mean, that is, if
that's still your dream


01:19:43.448 --> 01:19:44.896
and everything. - Yes.


01:19:44.931 --> 01:19:46.251
- Is it still your dream? - Mmhm, mmhm.


01:19:46.275 --> 01:19:47.413
- Mmhm.
- Mmhm!


01:19:51.344 --> 01:19:53.344
- Your dream is my dream, OK?


01:19:56.379 --> 01:19:57.379
OK.


01:20:08.068 --> 01:20:09.931
- Hi, hi, hi!


01:20:09.965 --> 01:20:11.068
Hi! - Hi!


01:20:11.103 --> 01:20:12.034
May I help you?


01:20:12.068 --> 01:20:13.413
- Yes, yes.


01:20:13.448 --> 01:20:14.631
I'm Shelby Steele and I'm with WBX News,
right?


01:20:14.655 --> 01:20:16.493
And I'm supposed to be
in there like right now,


01:20:16.517 --> 01:20:18.862
but some woman,
she kicked me out.


01:20:18.896 --> 01:20:20.448
He knows who I'm talkin' about.


01:20:20.482 --> 01:20:21.931
Could you, I don't even know


01:20:21.965 --> 01:20:23.044
who she is. - We don't like the words


01:20:23.068 --> 01:20:24.275
kicked out.


01:20:24.310 --> 01:20:26.275
Let's just say you were
selectively dismissed.


01:20:26.310 --> 01:20:29.068
- Select... wait.


01:20:29.103 --> 01:20:31.137
OK, what just happened?


01:20:31.172 --> 01:20:35.137
'Scuse me, uh, lady?


01:20:35.172 --> 01:20:37.413
Uh, lady in red.


01:20:37.448 --> 01:20:38.586
Get your girl.


01:20:38.620 --> 01:20:40.206
OK, y'all workin' together.


01:20:40.241 --> 01:20:43.379
OK, white people involved now,
OK it's gotten real.


01:20:43.413 --> 01:20:47.000
All right, I'm out
here on the red carpet.


01:20:51.655 --> 01:20:55.310
Media pass.


01:20:55.344 --> 01:20:57.965
Whatever happened
to black magic, huh?


01:20:58.000 --> 01:20:59.068
- Hello ladies!


01:20:59.103 --> 01:21:01.448
Are you ready to excel?


01:21:01.482 --> 01:21:02.896
- Yeah!


01:21:11.275 --> 01:21:13.241
- I love this energy!


01:21:13.275 --> 01:21:14.275
Nice!


01:21:15.068 --> 01:21:16.482
Woo! All right!


01:21:16.517 --> 01:21:19.586
I am Tia Logan, the
angry black woman,


01:21:19.620 --> 01:21:22.379
and I, you saw the show right?


01:21:22.413 --> 01:21:24.068
You saw the show, yes.


01:21:24.103 --> 01:21:26.448
I'm the angry black woman
and I am here to help you


01:21:26.482 --> 01:21:29.034
release, right? - Yeah, yes.


01:21:29.068 --> 01:21:31.034
- Yes, right?


01:21:31.068 --> 01:21:32.689
I think the best way
to get this started


01:21:32.724 --> 01:21:35.275
is just to dig in with
your questions, right?


01:21:35.310 --> 01:21:38.275
So uh, let's just talk.


01:21:40.379 --> 01:21:42.241
- I'm going to start right in.


01:21:42.275 --> 01:21:47.275
Do you think it's unhealthy to
go through your man's phone?


